// countdown-x.lmc - LMC-X (NON-OCR extension). IMMEDIATE addressing: SUB #1 needs no `one DAT 1`.
// Compare with ../countdown.lmc
// Input: 4         Output: 4, 3, 2, 1
        INP
loop    BRZ end
        OUT
        SUB #1          // immediate: subtract the number 1 itself
        BRA loop
end     HLT
